# pyrowave-planes.spv is glslang 16.3.0's output for pyrowave.hlsl (16.3.0 rebuilt the module
# before it, glslang 15.1.0's, byte for byte); the command is in
# docs/pyrowave-decode.md ("Shader module"). Regenerate the module after any change to the
# shader or to frame_warp.hlsl, which it includes, and put the three SHA-256s here (the shaders'
# with LF line endings): a unit test
# (`pyrowave_gpu::tests::the_planes_module_was_built_from_the_shader_as_it_is`) compares them.
pyrowave.hlsl 68d64176a309c3e8d7ef9af684742db6960fb7eecf815162d93e927ce2b84cf8
frame_warp.hlsl fbaa40acfc912b7b8f3902212b21f68191b29d5c15fc4c5d9785584afbd8ef43
pyrowave-planes.spv 950080a8a802505d0dbb0fe366f6b322bc0205df5fc3a31f539d9fd02557d7e4
